{
  "title": "Temporal localization of RR variability does not establish incremental external AF discrimination",
  "abstract": "Temporal entropy of RR-change energy did not establish improved AF discrimination from AFDB (25 records) to LTAFDB (83 retained records): equal-record external log-loss change +0.00007922, joint record-bootstrap95% [-0.010967,0.027243]. This is exploratory external-dataset assessment, not untouched confirmation.",
